// initialization
ex uninited #timer_active data run scb players set #timer_active data 0
ex uninited #progress data run scb players set #progress data 0
ex uninited #timer data run scb players set #timer data 0

ex uninited #boss_timer_active data run scb players set #boss_timer_active data 0
ex uninited #boss_timer data run scb players set #boss_timer data 0

ex uninited #attack_damage data run scb players set #attack_damage data 0
ex uninited #attack_speed data run scb players set #attack_speed data 0
ex uninited #health data run scb players set #health data 0

ex uninited #chest_timer data run scb players set #chest_timer data 0
ex uninited #valter_rose_timer data run scb players set #valter_rose_timer data 0
